---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ClosingCTA from '../components/ClosingCTA.astro';
import Mockup from '../components/Mockup.astro';
import Img from '../components/Img.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import { HOME_FAQ, faqSchema } from '../data/site';
import danKovac from '../assets/images/dan-kovac.jpg';
import Scene from '../components/Scene.astro';
import reportCover from '../assets/images/report/example-report-cover.png';
import reportSummary from '../assets/images/report/example-report-summary.png';
import reportRoadmap from '../assets/images/report/example-report-roadmap.png';
import bgMap from '../assets/images/backgrounds/process-diagram-whiteboard.jpg';
import bgFind from '../assets/images/backgrounds/factory-conveyor-line.jpg';
import bgBuild from '../assets/images/backgrounds/warehouse-clipboard.jpg';
import bgSession from '../assets/images/backgrounds/talking-at-laptop.jpg';
---
<Base
  title='AI Consultant for Australian Businesses | Roadmap Labs'
  description='AI consulting for established Australian businesses. We connect AI to the systems you already use, train your team and put a dollar value on every automation.'
  path="/"
  schema={[faqSchema(HOME_FAQ)]}
>

<section class="hm-hero">
  <div class="hm-hero__inner">
    <div class="hm-hero__copy">
      <h1 class="rl-rise">AI consulting and implementation <span>for established Australian businesses.</span></h1>
      <p class="hm-hero__lead rl-rise rl-d1">We help you understand where AI fits in your business, then make it work with the systems you already run on.</p>
      <div class="hm-hero__actions rl-rise rl-d2">
        <a class="rl-btn rl-btn--lg" href="/contact">Book your free session</a>
        <a class="rl-link-action" href="/work">See the work</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hm-hero__note rl-rise rl-d2">Melbourne-based, working across Australia.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hm-stage rl-rise rl-d1" role="img" aria-label="An example Roadmap Labs report: the cover, a summary showing about $33,000 expected in year one, and five automations ranked by what each returns">
    <div class="hm-stage__slab" aria-hidden="true">
      <Img src={reportSummary} alt="" class="hm-page hm-page--summary" sizes="(max-width: 999px) 46vw, 420px" widths={[320, 480, 640, 911]} eager />
      <Img src={reportRoadmap} alt="" class="hm-page hm-page--roadmap" sizes="(max-width: 999px) 46vw, 420px" widths={[320, 480, 640, 911]} eager priority />
      <Img src={reportCover} alt="" class="hm-page hm-page--cover" sizes="(max-width: 999px) 46vw, 420px" widths={[320, 480, 640, 911]} eager />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="ev-dark ev-signal">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; gap: 16px">
      <span class="ev-eyebrow">Sound familiar?</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 56px); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 500; max-width: 18ch; color: var(--paper)">Feeling behind on AI? We'll get you ahead of it.</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="ev-worries" aria-label="Common worries">
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Our competitors are already using it</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Our CRM, email and ads don't talk to each other</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Our tech stack is too complicated for AI to work with</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Half the team uses ChatGPT or Claude, and half don't</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>We're too close to the business to see what to fix</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Which AI provider and tools do we pick?</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Is it secure and compliant?</li>
      <li class="ev-worry"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 16.5v.5"/></svg>Will token costs go up and burn us?</li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="ev-rule" style="margin-top: 24px">

    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px 48px">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
        <span class="ev-eyebrow">How our AI consulting works</span>
        <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 40px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-weight: 500; color: var(--paper)">How we get you there, in three steps</h3>
      </div>
      <a class="rl-btn rl-btn--lg" href="/contact" style="background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink)">Book your free session</a>
    </div>

    <ol class="ev-steps">
      <li class="ev-step">
        <span class="ev-node" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <Scene bg={bgMap} class="ev-scene--step" label="Example process map: lead, proposal, sale and invoice, running across the CRM, inbox, ads and spreadsheets">
          <div class="rl-ui">
            <div class="rl-ui__row"><span class="rl-ui__meta">Process map</span><span class="rl-pill rl-pill--quiet">Example</span></div>
            <div class="ev-rows">
              <div class="ev-flow"><span>Lead</span><i></i><span>Proposal</span><i></i><span>Sale</span><i></i><span>Invoice</span></div>
              <span class="rl-ui__meta">Runs across</span>
              <div class="ev-chips"><span>CRM</span><span>Inbox</span><span>Ads</span><span>Spreadsheets</span></div>
            </div>
            <span class="rl-ui__meta">How the business really runs</span>
          </div>
        </Scene>
        <h3>Map your systems and processes</h3>
        <p>We sit with your team and map how the business really runs, across your CRM, inbox, ads and spreadsheets. Then we build on the systems that got you here.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="ev-step">
        <span class="ev-node" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <Scene bg={bgFind} class="ev-scene--step" label="Example bottlenecks: following up quotes, building proposals and data entry, with the top one costing $18,720 a year">
          <div class="rl-ui">
            <div class="rl-ui__row"><span class="rl-ui__meta">Where time and money leak</span><span class="rl-pill rl-pill--quiet">Example</span></div>
            <div class="ev-rows">
              <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><span>Following up quotes</span><div class="rl-bar"><i style="width: 92%"></i></div></div>
              <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Building proposals</span><div class="rl-bar ev-bar-quiet"><i style="width: 64%"></i></div></div>
              <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Data entry</span><div class="rl-bar ev-bar-quiet"><i style="width: 41%"></i></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ev-total"><span>Cost each year</span><strong>$18,720</strong></div>
          </div>
        </Scene>
        <h3>Find the biggest bottlenecks</h3>
        <p>We find where time and money leak, and put a 12-month dollar figure on each bottleneck holding the business back.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="ev-step">
        <span class="ev-node" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <Scene bg={bgBuild} class="ev-scene--step" label="Example automation roadmap: quote follow-ups ranked first, then building proposals and invoice matching, each built, tested and handed over with training">
          <div class="rl-ui">
            <div class="rl-ui__row"><span class="rl-ui__meta">Automation roadmap</span><span class="rl-pill rl-pill--quiet">Example</span></div>
            <div class="ev-rows">
              <div class="rl-ui__row"><span>1. Quote follow-ups</span><span class="rl-pill">Top value</span></div>
              <div class="rl-ui__row" style="color: var(--text-secondary)"><span>2. Building proposals</span></div>
              <div class="rl-ui__row" style="color: var(--text-secondary)"><span>3. Invoice matching</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="ev-checks" style="padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid #e6e7ec"><span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg> Built</span><span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg> Tested</span><span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg> Team trained</span></div>
          </div>
        </Scene>
        <h3>Build your automation roadmap</h3>
        <p>Every automation ranked by what it saves over 12 months. You pick what we build, then we test it, hand it over and train your team to use it.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--paper)">
  <div class="ev-pad--top" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px 0; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; max-width: 720px">
      <span class="ev-eyebrow">Why established businesses work with us</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-weight: 500">We build on the systems that made you successful</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ev-why">
      <div class="ev-why__card">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8b8d98" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20h16M6 16V9M10 16V5M14 16v-6M18 16V7"/></svg>
        <h3>Keep what works</h3>
        <p>We improve the tools and processes you already run on. We'll only suggest something new once we've got real value out of what's there.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev-why__card">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8b8d98" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M14.8 9.2c-.5-.8-1.5-1.2-2.8-1.2-1.7 0-2.8.8-2.8 2s1.1 1.7 2.8 2 2.8.8 2.8 2-1.1 2-2.8 2c-1.3 0-2.3-.4-2.8-1.2M12 6.5v1.5M12 16v1.5"/></svg>
        <h3>A dollar figure on everything</h3>
        <p>Every automation comes with what it saves over 12 months, so you choose what to build with the numbers in front of you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev-why__card">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8b8d98" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"/><path d="M3.5 19c.6-3 2.8-5 5.5-5s4.9 2 5.5 5"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.5"/><path d="M16 14.2c2.3.2 4 1.9 4.5 4.8"/></svg>
        <h3>The whole team on board</h3>
        <p>We roll AI out across your team securely, with the right skills set up and training, so everyone uses it the same way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev-why__card">
        <svg aria-hidden="true" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8b8d98" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18M7 15h4"/></svg>
        <h3>Stop paying for software you barely use</h3>
        <p>We often see businesses paying $3,000+ a month for Salesforce and using about 10% of it. We'll show you where your tooling money goes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--paper)">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px; box-sizing: border-box">
    <div class="rl-split" style="align-items: stretch">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; gap: 20px">
        <span class="rl-tag">Free · 1 hour · Online</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-weight: 500">A free hour on where AI fits in your business</h2>
        <ul class="ev-checklist">
          <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Your bottlenecks.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Where the time and money go, and what's holding the business back.</span></span></li>
          <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Your goals.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Where you want the business to be, and what AI can realistically do to get it there.</span></span></li>
          <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Our suggestions.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">The tools and automations that suit a business like yours.</span></span></li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 34em">Within 48 hours you get a custom report: your business mapped, the automations that suit you, and what each one saves over 12 months. You pick what to build. Run it with us or manage it yourself. There's no lock-in, and no risk in the conversation.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 28px; padding-top: 4px">
          <a class="rl-btn rl-btn--lg" href="/contact">Book your free session</a>
          <a class="rl-link-action" href="/contact" style="padding: 12px 0">What happens after the session</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Scene bg={bgSession} class="ev-scene--center" label="Example custom report, ready within 48 hours: your business mapped, the automations that suit you and a 12-month value on each one">
      <div class="rl-ui">
        <div class="rl-ui__row"><span class="rl-ui__meta">Your custom report</span><span class="rl-pill rl-pill--quiet">Example</span></div>
        <div style="font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.015em">Ready within 48 hours</div>
        <div class="ev-report__checks">
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>Your business mapped</span>
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>Automations that suit you</span>
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>A 12-month value on each one</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>1. Quote follow-ups</span><span class="rl-pill">Top value</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 92%"></i></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>2. Building proposals</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 64%"></i></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>3. Data entry</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 41%"></i></div></div>
        <span class="rl-ui__meta">Ranked by what each saves over 12 months</span>
      </Scene>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--fog)">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 16px">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px">
        <span class="ev-eyebrow">Our work</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-weight: 500">AI and automation case studies</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="rl-link-action" href="/work">All case studies</a>
    </div>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 24px">
      <a href="/work/compass-buyers-agency" class="ev-case">
        <div class="mk-stage" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #3a6b68 0%, #173a39 100%)"><span class="rl-tag ev-case__tag">Client work</span><Mockup case="compass" sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 384px" /></div>
        <div class="ev-case__body">
          <h3>Compass Buyers Agency</h3>
          <p>A data-driven website that reports on every suburb they buy in, and a bespoke web app that runs the business behind it.</p>
          <span class="rl-link-action" style="margin-top: 8px">Read the case study</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/work/reviewbuddy" class="ev-case">
        <div class="mk-stage" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #4cc2ff 0%, #1f9be6 100%)"><span class="rl-tag ev-case__tag">Our product</span><Mockup case="reviewbuddy" sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 384px" /></div>
        <div class="ev-case__body">
          <h3>ReviewBuddy</h3>
          <p>A reviews platform in live pilot, and growing on the same kind of automations we build for clients.</p>
          <span class="rl-link-action" style="margin-top: 8px">Read the case study</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/work/flexfolio" class="ev-case">
        <div class="mk-stage" style="background: linear-gradient(160deg, #2a2a2a 0%, #0b0b0b 100%)"><span class="rl-tag ev-case__tag">Our product</span><Mockup case="flexfolio" sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1100px) 50vw, 384px" /></div>
        <div class="ev-case__body">
          <h3>Flexfolio</h3>
          <p>A portfolio platform that shows how product managers think, now in pilot with 30 PMs.</p>
          <span class="rl-link-action" style="margin-top: 8px">Read the case study</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px; box-sizing: border-box">
  <div class="rl-split">
    <figure class="rl-photo" style="aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; max-width: 460px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; background: var(--fog)"><Img src={danKovac} alt="Dan Kovac, founder of Roadmap Labs" style="filter: none; mix-blend-mode: normal; object-position: 50% 0%" sizes="(max-width: 720px) calc(100vw - 48px), 460px" /></figure>
    <div>
      <span class="ev-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 16px">Who you'll work with</span>
      <h2>Hi, I'm Dan. I'm passionate about helping Aussie businesses scale with AI</h2>
      <p>I spent 10 years running a digital marketing agency, and I've been implementing AI systems since 2012, long before ChatGPT made it mainstream. That's the experience I bring to every roadmap.</p>
      <a class="rl-link-action" href="/about">More about Dan</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--fog)">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px">
    <div style="flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px">
      <span class="ev-eyebrow">FAQ</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.21; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 500">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <Faq items={HOME_FAQ} />
  </div>
</section>

<ClosingCTA />

</Base>
